      "en": "They divide my garments among them. They cast lots for my clothing.",
      "ko": "내 겉옷을 나누며 속옷을 제비 뽑나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "2693f7937bd6da209298f6944de33ca914e1eab01d5f7a06c8c954b338d304a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "7815d55959ba8a25d6189af144eaeb72fab559209200aff1f71432be72c07589",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내 겉옷을 나누며 속옷을 제비 뽑나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7815d55959ba8a25d6189af144eaeb72fab559209200aff1f71432be72c07589"
      ]
    },
    {
